@startuml

' ===== 字体与样式设置 =====
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontName SimHei
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 20
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam noteBorderColor #666666

' ===== 参与者 =====
actor "用户" as User
participant "古树检索界面" as SearchPage
participant "TreeController" as Controller
participant "TreeService" as Service
participant "DHLAM模型" as DHLAM
participant "TreeMapper" as Mapper
participant "MySQL数据库" as DB

' ===== 前置条件说明 =====
note over User, SearchPage
  <b>前置条件：</b>用户已完成登录
end note

' ===== 核心检索流程（以I2I为主链路） =====
autonumber 1
User -> SearchPage: 上传查询图像或输入坐标(lat,lon)
activate SearchPage

autonumber 2
SearchPage -> Controller: POST /tree/retrieve
activate Controller

autonumber 3
Controller -> Service: retrieve(TreeRetrieveReq, file)
activate Service

autonumber 4
Service -> DHLAM: 模型推理(查询图像/坐标)
activate DHLAM

autonumber 5
DHLAM -> DHLAM: ImageEncoder(ResNet-50)提取512维图像特征

autonumber 6
DHLAM -> DHLAM: LocationEncoder(MLP)编码256维位置特征

autonumber 7
DHLAM -> DHLAM: 多模态融合(Concat)生成768维融合特征

autonumber 8
DHLAM -> DHLAM: 哈希层(FC→Tanh→Sign)生成128位二进制哈希码

autonumber 9
DHLAM --> Service: 返回 hashCode + hashBits
deactivate DHLAM

autonumber 10
Service -> Mapper: 查询古树及图像哈希数据
activate Mapper

autonumber 11
Mapper -> DB: 关联查询 tree + image 表
activate DB
DB --> Mapper: 返回古树与图像哈希记录
deactivate DB

autonumber 12
Mapper --> Service: 返回 List<Tree+Image>
deactivate Mapper

autonumber 13
Service -> Service: 计算汉明距离并排序(Top-K)

autonumber 14
Service --> Controller: 返回检索结果列表
deactivate Service

autonumber 15
Controller --> SearchPage: 返回古树信息JSON
note right
  {
    "content": [
      { "treeCode":"001", "name":"景山万春亭古柏",
        "similarity":0.945, "image":"/tree/image/001" }
    ]
  }
end note
deactivate Controller

autonumber 16
SearchPage --> User: 渲染检索结果列表
deactivate SearchPage

' ===== 三种检索模式说明 =====
note over Controller, Mapper
  <b>三种检索模式差异（DHLAM输入路径不同）</b>
  I2I: 图像→ImageEncoder→哈希层→汉明距离检索相似图像
  I2L: 图像+位置→双模态融合→哈希层→返回地理位置
  L2I: 坐标→LocationEncoder→哈希层→检索附近图像
end note

@enduml
